              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner Antonio Dwayne Halbert is challenging a decision by the Michigan Court of Appeals that denied his appeal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "MR. MORAN",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ce9fddf05fb871493711c11d44b1b92e01b54464926cab658c92fbf6fbb45589",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ce9fddf05fb8-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The dispute centers on whether the Michigan constitutional provision that requires a guilty\u2011plea appellant to seek leave to appeal constitutes a waiver of the automatic right to appeal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "State",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ce9fddf05fb871493711c11d44b1b92e01b54464926cab658c92fbf6fbb45589",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ce9fddf05fb8-0001-0004",
              "ev-ce9fddf05fb8-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The State argues that the federal AEDPA standard of review applies to the denial, granting deference to the state court's decision."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
